OL,3,ABrazilians choosing between Lula and
OL,4,ABolsonaro's son in presidential
OL,5,Aelection run-off
OL,6,
OL,7,FArriving at a polling station in Rio de
OL,8,FJaneiro early this morning, Bolsonaro
OL,9,Ftold reporters the "time has come for
OL,10,Freal change"
OL,12,FMeanwhile, Lula greeted supporters
OL,13,Foutside a polling station as he cast
OL,14,Fhis vote in Sao Bernardo do Campo
